[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8222.469, "timestamp": "02:17:02", "text": "还有什么呢？是的。我知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8224.15, "timestamp": "02:17:04", "text": "你要去日本之类的国家，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8225.75, "timestamp": "02:17:05", "text": "东西什么的都有，我太兴奋了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8227.91, "timestamp": "02:17:07", "text": "为你。我很高兴你知道这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8230.15, "timestamp": "02:17:10", "text": "你知道，你正在迈出这重要的一步。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8232.95, "timestamp": "02:17:12", "text": "就像迈出了一大步，我的意思是，这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8236.549, "timestamp": "02:17:16", "text": "这是巨大的一步，因为我觉得我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8238.07, "timestamp": "02:17:18", "text": "我曾经一度想那样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8240.309, "timestamp": "02:17:20", "text": "但我始终无法付诸行动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8241.75, "timestamp": "02:17:21", "text": "你知道，你正在做这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8243.509, "timestamp": "02:17:23", "text": "太可怕了，真的太可怕了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8245.11, "timestamp": "02:17:25", "text": "你住在另一个州，你要去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8246.87, "timestamp": "02:17:26", "text": "到一个全新的，你知道，全新的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8248.309, "timestamp": "02:17:28", "text": "国家语言各异"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8249.99, "timestamp": "02:17:29", "text": "一切，而你正在做的就是这些。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8252.07, "timestamp": "02:17:32", "text": "你真勇敢，你知道你能行的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8254.549, "timestamp": "02:17:34", "text": "祝你一切顺利。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8256.07, "timestamp": "02:17:36", "text": "祝你一切顺利，我为你加油！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8259.509, "timestamp": "02:17:39", "text": "我会为你加油的，你知道的，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8262.349, "timestamp": "02:17:42", "text": "是的，我在这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8265.91, "timestamp": "02:17:45", "text": "你知道的，鸭子。是啊，我们应该一起出去玩。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8267.99, "timestamp": "02:17:47", "text": "未来也希望能够再次合作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8272.589, "ti